{"id":"wb-4-113","name":"北京东岳庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北京东岳庙","text":"北京东岳庙，位于中国北京市朝阳区朝阳门外大街141号，是道教正一派在华北地区的第一大丛林，现同时为北京民俗博物馆。庙内保存了大量各具特色的道教建筑和历代碑刻，对研究中国古代道教以及玄教的历史渊源和发展具有重要的参考价值。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%B8%9C%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94837549,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94837549","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/50eb2009746486b28935a887.jpg","title":"北京市民俗博物館·東岳廟·北京朝外大街·（二道門）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E4%BF%97%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8%C2%B7%E6%9D%B1%E5%B2%B3%E5%BB%9F%C2%B7%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%9C%9D%E5%A4%96%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%97%C2%B7%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E9%81%93%E9%96%80%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E4%BF%97%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8%C2%B7%E6%9D%B1%E5%B2%B3%E5%BB%9F%C2%B7%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%9C%9D%E5%A4%96%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%97%C2%B7%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%E9%81%93%E9%96%80%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Legolas1024","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​東岳廟現今正門（原正門因拓寬朝外大街被拆毀）","width":320,"height":427}}